    "q-142936": {
      "dom_id": "step-q142936",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "| $f$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.15$ | $0.1$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.3$ | $0.2$ |\n| $X=4$ | $0.15$ | $0.1$ |\n\nFind the conditional probability mass function ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,2)$ given that the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above.",
      "worked_solution": "The conditional probability mass function ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)$ is defined as\n\n$$\n{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)=P(X=x\\,|\\,Y=y).\n$$\n\nTherefore, we're required to compute the following set of conditional probabilities:\n\n$$\n{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,2)=P(X=x\\,|\\,Y=2)\n$$\n\nBy the multiplication law for conditional probability, we have\n\n$$\nP(X=x\\,|\\,Y=2)=\\frac{P(X=x,Y=2)}{P(Y=2)}=\\frac{f(x,2)}{{f}_{Y}(2)}\n$$\n\nwhere $f(x,y)$ is the joint probability mass function of $X$ and $Y,$ and ${f}_{Y}(y)$ is the marginal distribution of $Y.$\n\nRecall that the marginal distributions for $X$ and $Y$ correspond to the row and column totals, respectively. So, let's compute these:\n\n| $f$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ | ${f}_{X}(x)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.15$ | $0.1$ | $0.25$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.3$ | $0.2$ | $0.5$ |\n| $X=4$ | $0.15$ | $0.1$ | $0.25$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.6$ | $0.4$ | $1$ |\n\nTherefore, for $x\\in \\{0,2,4\\},$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=0\\,|\\,Y=2) & =\\frac{f(0,2)}{{f}_{Y}(2)}=\\frac{0.1}{0.4}=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ P(X=2\\,|\\,Y=2) & =\\frac{f(2,2)}{{f}_{Y}(2)}=\\frac{0.2}{0.4}=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ P(X=4\\,|\\,Y=2) & =\\frac{f(4,2)}{{f}_{Y}(2)}=\\frac{0.1}{0.4}=\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the conditional probability mass function can be represented by the following table:   \n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $2$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,2)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-142936-a",
              "type": "text",
